  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 yɛ adwuma a AI nko ara na ɛyɛeɛ.<\/0> Orion-81 ankasa code no line biara, wɔde Claude Code twerɛeɛ, ɔtedeɛ na ɔkyerɛɛ kwan. Ahyɛn biara, map, texture ne nne biara, adwinnadeɛ a Claude Code twerɛeɛ no na ɛyɛeɛ. Ɔtedeɛ na ɔpaw nea wɔbɛyɛ; Claude Code na ɔhunu sɛdeɛ wɔbɛyɛ. Open-source libraries a ɛgyina so no wɔ ase wɔ Ɛnyɛ AI na ɛyɛeɛ ase. Biribi baako da so ho hwehwɛ, na yɛkyerɛ no ankasa: agoru no code a efi GPL nhwɛsoɔ no mu bae no <1>kwan hwehwɛ<\/1>.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Orion fii ase wɔ September 28, 2026 sɛ nhwɛsoɔ wɔ Quake III Arena engine a ɛyɛ open-source (GPL) so, na Elite Dangerous ahyɛn na ɛmaa no adwene. Da a ɛtɔ so mmienu, agoru no code kɔɔ BuB so, engine foforɔ a wɔde Claude Code twerɛeɛ; agoru no modules fi nhwɛsoɔ no mu bae na wɔsesaa wɔn din. Release 0.3.0 maa ahyɛn kuw 16 nyinaa nipadua foforɔ a ɛyɛ wɔn de. Kwan hwehwɛ rehwɛ sɛ code no bi da so fi GPL ankasa no mu anaa, ne sɛ ahyɛn nhyehyɛeɛ a edi kan no gye ho nsɛm kɛse bi anaa. Wɔde automated similarity scan twaa code no ne GPL nhwɛsoɔ no source ho ntotoɔ wɔ October 8, 2026, na ɔbenfoɔ nhwehwɛmu a ɛfa nea ɛhyia no ho rekɔ so. Biribiara a efi mu no, wɔbɛtwerɛ bio anaa wɔbɛsan ahyehyɛ.",
