  "d.1dlyq4f": "Km 420 wɔ anadwo fa so, simma mmiɛnsa ansa na orbital ɔsrane reba. Ashgrove Station, nkɔsoo a efi dedaw mu bubu mu, ne Europe hann a ɛtwam wɔ ase.",
