  "d.1ea9win": "Ahyɛn kɛseɛ a ɛgyae nkatadeɛ na ɛnya drive fa kɛseɛ ne spinal rail duru mmienu.",
  "d.1eoopdx": "Lock-on rɔkɛts: wɔkyerɛ rɔkɛt kwan nko sɛ ne lock no yɛ pɛ bere a ɛtu no.",
  "d.1eytq94": "Release 0.3.0 ma ahyɛn kuw 16 nyinaa nipadua foforɔ (hwɛ nko ara: din, adwuma, nkyerɛwee ne akode sisibea nhyehyɛeɛ kɔ so).",
