  "d.1gzjma": "AHUNUHUNU",
  "d.1gzr9mh": "BASTION sɛnea ɛte wɔ agoru no hangar menu mu, version 0.6.1 nipadua, nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu anim hwɛ wɔ tuntum so.",
  "d.1h04cn8": "Nsɛso a ɛte sɛ foto ankasa: image-based hann, ambient occlusion, ewia sunsuma a ɛnhyɛ ne filmic grade, ne REALISM menu toggle, ne BASTION ne IRONCLAD nipadua a wɔasiesie.",
