  "d.1hhlmv3": "Rɔkɛt pɔw nsia.",
  "d.1hi6fk9": "HALBERD, hangar mfonini a efi agoru menu mu (nipadua sɛnea wɔyɛeɛ ma 0.3.0 ne nea ɛdi n'akyi; ankasa ɛware 256 x 128). Agoru no mfonini, version 0.6.1",
  "d.1hiyfm4": "Abotan a ɛtu kɔ.",
  "d.1hrnfcm": "RAMPART sɛnea ɛte wɔ agoru no hangar menu mu, version 0.6.1 nipadua, nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu anim hwɛ wɔ tuntum so.",
  "d.1hwe7q8": "Version 0.2.2 wɔabobɔ mu: camera a ɛwɔ ahofadie ne AUTO nhyehyɛeɛ a ɛtow hyɛ ɔtamfoɔ a ɔbɛn no so.",
  "d.1i6l74z": "Twam a ɛkɔ fam wɔ Copernicus apuei fa afasu a ɛwɔ anamɔn anamɔn so wɔ ewiabere terminator no mu, Asase wɔ soro. Asase tweetwee fa nsia mu baako ne wim nni hɔ: kwan biara yɛ ballistic.",
  "d.1ib4qda": "Ebinom soa rotary miniguns a ɛgyina hɔ wɔ lasers nkyɛn.",
  "d.1iglk9h": "PERIHELION, 4 SOLAR RADII: Ewia kuruwa a ne nkyerɛmu ne ahonyadeɛ wɔ so.",
  "d.1imx84h": "LOW EARTH ORBIT: kruwa gyinabea a ewia nkyɛn wɔ so wɔ Asase kyinkyim soro.",
  "d.1iuw2c3": "Camera a ɛkyinkyim wɔ ahofadie mu, AUTO ɔkwan a ɛtow hyɛ ɔtamfoɔ a ɔbɛn no so, switch a ɛda AUTO ne kwan a wɔkura mu, ne ɔkwan a ɛyɛ mmerɛw a ɛde nsa san ma kyerɛfoɔ no.",
  "d.1j7mgjz": "Atamfoɔ AI ANVILs pue wɔn ntaban wɔ ako mu, nsoa ahyɛn san ba dock, ahyɛn hyɛ wɔn nsoafoɔ kyɛm ahosu, na railguns sɔ mu ankasa.",
  "d.1kbbopx": "Web fonts a ɛwɔ wɛbsaet yi so",
