  "d.1mqb5qu": "Wɔde Kickstarter sika bɛfa nkurɔfoɔ a wɔdi kan a wɔyɛ developers ne mfonini nhyehyɛfoɔ a AI ama wɔafi adwuma mu.",
  "d.1ncvhzy": "Laser hann a ɛretu. Agoru no mfonini, version 0.5.0",
