  "d.1o102o0": "THRESHER, hangar mfonini a efi agoru menu mu (nipadua sɛnea wɔyɛeɛ ma 0.3.0 ne nea ɛdi n'akyi; ankasa ɛware 256 x 128). Agoru no mfonini, version 0.6.1",
