  "d.1q40xi9": "LEVIATHAN, hangar mfonini a efi agoru menu mu (nipadua sɛnea wɔyɛeɛ ma 0.3.0 ne nea ɛdi n'akyi; ankasa ɛware 256 x 128). Agoru no mfonini, version 0.6.1",
  "d.1qabcqp": "Hard-science-fiction nsɛso a ɛgyina nokware so, mfiridwuma a ɛkɔ fa mu, rɔkɛts ne railguns, ahyɛn 16 fi 12 m kosi 1.2 km, ne Glasgow map no.",
