  "d.1tn70tl": "KESTREL, hangar mfonini a efi agoru menu mu (nipadua sɛnea wɔyɛeɛ ma 0.3.0 ne nea ɛdi n'akyi; ankasa ɛware 256 x 128). Agoru no mfonini, version 0.6.1",
  "d.1u1n685": "WARHOUND sɛnea ɛte wɔ agoru no hangar menu mu, version 0.6.1 nipadua, nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu anim hwɛ wɔ tuntum so.",
  "d.1uzcurt": "Orion Defense Initiative adwumayɛfoɔ: laser nnan, akode mmerɛw a ɛwɔ abɔ ne rɔkɛt fie a ɛkura nsia.",
