  "d.1wzm242": "Box arena a ɛware km 20 ne km 20 ne km 10.",
  "d.1x5oilr": "Developer nhyehyɛeɛ (boost, rɔkɛt ntam, fie ntam bere), squadron nneyɛeɛ, ROCKETS INCOMING nsɛnkyerɛnne ne akode hwiriwhwiri nipa-nsa-mmiɛnsa agyinaeɛ.",
  "d.1x6m51e": "Version 0.2.0 wɔabobɔ mu: kɛkɛ network mu agodifoɔ pii ne maps foforɔ mmiɛnsa (LUNA, EARTH ORBIT, SOL).",
  "d.1xdakgt": "WARHOUND, hangar mfonini a efi agoru menu mu (nipadua sɛnea wɔyɛeɛ ma 0.3.0 ne nea ɛdi n'akyi; ankasa ɛware 256 x 128). Agoru no mfonini, version 0.6.1",
  "d.1xeup9p": "Kwan hwehwɛ da so ho: automated similarity scan twaa code no ne GPL nhwɛsoɔ no source ho ntotoɔ wɔ {date0}, na ɔbenfoɔ nhwehwɛmu a ɛfa nea ɛhyia no ho rekɔ so.",
  "d.1xktp85": "KORVET A ƐTOW HYƐ",
  "d.1xw8628": "BRAWLER sɛnea ɛte wɔ agoru no hangar menu mu, version 0.6.1 nipadua, nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu anim hwɛ wɔ tuntum so.",
  "d.1y1vl1m": "Ahyɛn a ɛkɔ brɛoo na nkatadeɛ wɔ so a ɛsoa nneɛma. Akode hwiriwhwiri nnan ne PD mounts mmienu ma atuafoɔ twɛn wɔn ho.",
  "d.1yawpsx": "MINIGƆNS",
