  "d.1yq2qk7": "THETA-7 ASTEROID FIELD, baabi mfonini a efi agoru menu mu. Agoru no mfonini, version 0.6.1",
  "d.1ysusgc": "Sɛnea ahyɛn a wotua ka ma no bɛyɛ pɛ wɔ ɔkoɔ a nkurɔfoɔ ne nkurɔfoɔ ko mu, wɔda so rehyehyɛ no.",
  "d.21ryis": "ATTACK ahyɛdeɛ sesa fi botaeɛ baako ne nea ɛbɛn.",
  "d.2pbr86": "Mfinimfini",
  "d.2r8k8j": "AWIA TEBEA",
  "d.2sqinp": "Ahyɛn mmiɛnsa a engine wusiw wɔ so wɔ Glasgow nwunu so, kyerɛfoɔ no ahyɛn tu wɔ anim.",
  "d.2vomdh": "Automated similarity scan twaa agoru no code ne GPL nhwɛsoɔ no source ho ntotoɔ wɔ {date0}. Ɔbenfoɔ nhwehwɛmu a ɛfa nea ɛhyia no ho rekɔ so. Biribiara a wobehu sɛ wɔtwaa anaa wɔsakraa no no, wɔbɛtwerɛ bio.",
  "d.32ogvm": "Engine wusiw a wɔasusuw fi nozzle no mu, ANVIL a ɛware 240 m a hangar ne apon hunu mu, NEEDLE nkɔ fi afa abien nyinaa, baako anaa botaeɛ a ɛbɛn ATTACK nsesa, ne AI ANVILs a wɔpue wɔn ntaban.",
  "d.3b0pca": "HWEHWƐFOƆ",
  "d.3bxw4p": "Nkurɔfoɔ nyinaa sika boaboa a edi kan.",
  "d.3ednu": "Nsakrae kɛseɛ fi AI-BuB engine no so kɔ Unreal Engine 5 so",
  "d.3m3q6c": "Ewia hyeɛ, ne ewia hyerɛn simma kakra biara.",
  "d.3wpyge": "Kuro a ɛware kilometa dunsia wɔ Clyde so wɔ ɔsoro a ɛyɛ nwunu ase. Asase tweetwee ankasa, wim ankasa, ɔdan atifi ne cranes: ma w'abɔfra nkɔ soro na ma wo hwene nni asubɔnten no so.",
  "d.4b5t91": "PERIHELION, 4 SOLAR RADII, baabi mfonini a efi agoru menu mu. Agoru no mfonini, version 0.6.1",
  "d.4p55jj": "ahyɛn kuw",
  "d.4pqks5": "Agoru no code kɔ BuB so, engine foforɔ a wɔde Claude Code twerɛeɛ. Agoru no modules fi nhwɛsoɔ no mu bae na wɔsesa wɔn din akyiri yi.",
  "d.4wz1ss": "LOADOUT skrin ansa na ako biara refi ase (ɔbaako agoru ne agodifoɔ pii lobi) ne nipadua ne kyɛm anamɔn, kyɛm ahosu, akode sisibea nsra ne ANVIL fie ahyɛn.",
  "d.5h9ajx": "LESAS",
  "d.5zdnfb": "Ahunuhunu: wim twe nni hɔ.",
  "d.61r5q7": "HANGAR A NEEDLE 10 WƆ MU",
  "d.6mw8fz": "Laser ne tuo akode hwiriwhwiri nhyehyɛeɛ a ɛfi ase wɔ AUTO mu.",
  "d.6vf32z": "Version 0 (nhwɛsoɔ) wɔabobɔ mu: ahyɛn kuw 8, lasers ne salvo ntuo, THETA-7 ɔbotan baabi.",
