  "d.709qra": "Kura so na ɛnyɛ hyɛ mu, gyae na ɛtow. Sɛ wogyae wɔ hyɛ 50 % anaa ɛboro so a, ɛtow; sɛ ɛso ntra so a, ɛgyae.",
  "d.7a27ds": "Akode sisibea agyinaeɛ, rɔkɛt pɔw nsia a camera di akyi, boost mmienu, ANVIL ripple lasers, ANVIL fie a ɛpue NEEDLE nnamfonom 10, ne camera-shake slider.",
  "d.7xvt5u": "Wɔde AI na ɛyɛ biribiara wɔ BuB engine so, wɔde Claude Code.",
  "d.87vl1g": "Kɛkɛ network mu agodifoɔ pii (hwehwɛ agoru wɔ Wi-Fi korɔ so, nya anaa kɔ lobi, tu bom; adwuma-mu-boa nsra ne obiara ne ne ho) ne maps foforɔ mmiɛnsa: LUNA, EARTH ORBIT ne SOL.",
  "d.899luq": "THRESHER sɛnea ɛte wɔ agoru no hangar menu mu, version 0.6.1 nipadua, nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu anim hwɛ wɔ tuntum so.",
