  "d.th2bvi": "Nkyɛmu, sɛnea ɛtoa so: L1, kuw id, nipadua digit + kyɛm digit, ahosu, akode sisibea tokens, ahyɛn id, ahyɛn nipadua digit + ahyɛn kyɛm digit, ahyɛn akode sisibea tokens. Ahosu yɛ '-' ma STOCK, 'p<k>' ma palette entry k, anaa hex digits nsia a ɛyɛ nkyerɛwee nketenkete. Nkyɛmu bi yɛ stock sɛ ɛyɛ '00' (anamɔn), '-' (ahosu, ahyɛn) anaa ɛyɛ hunu (akode sisibea); nkyɛmu stock biara a ɛdi nea ɛnyɛ stock a etwa to akyi no, wɔgyaw, nea ɛdi n'anim no, wɔkora. Ahyɛn nkyɛmu wɔ hɔ ma kuw a ɛwɔ hangar fie nko. Nsɛpaw a kuw no ntumi nfa no, wɔkan no sɛ STOCK.",
