  "economy.todayLead": "LOADOUT skrin no nipadua ne kyɛm anamɔn ne kyɛm ahosu (0.6.0) kyerɛ nkɔso ne ahosu nneɛma ahodoɔ a wɔpɛ sɛ sikasɛm no de bɛma.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Efisɛ ne sika no wɔ hɔ sɛ ɛtua wɔn. Agoru no fi ase sɛ AI na ɛyɛeɛ koraa sɛdeɛ ɛbɛtumi atena hɔ; afei mfonini nhyehyɛfoɔ a wotua wɔn ka sesa AI adwuma, na wɔka wɔn din.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Metumi adi agoru wɔ online?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Ɛyɛ agoru kwa?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Nsɛmmisa",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Dabi. LAN agodifoɔ pii wɔ network korɔ so yɛ adwuma nnɛ (fi 0.2.0); wɔnyɛɛ online agoru.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Wɔyɛɛ nhwɛsoɔ no wɔ Quake III Arena engine a ɛyɛ open-source (GPL) so na Elite Dangerous ahyɛn na ɛmaa no adwene. Da a ɛtɔ so mmienu, agoru no code kɔɔ BuB so, engine foforɔ a wɔde Claude Code twerɛeɛ; agoru no modules fi nhwɛsoɔ no mu bae na wɔsesaa wɔn din. Release 0.3.0 maa ahyɛn kuw 16 nyinaa nipadua foforɔ. Kwan hwehwɛ rehwɛ sɛ code no bi da so fi GPL ankasa no mu anaa, ne sɛ ahyɛn nhyehyɛeɛ a edi kan no gye ho nsɛm kɛse bi anaa. Wɔde automated similarity scan twaa code no ne GPL nhwɛsoɔ no source ho ntotoɔ wɔ <0/>, na ɔbenfoɔ nhwehwɛmu a ɛfa nea ɛhyia no ho rekɔ so. Biribiara a efi mu no, wɔbɛtwerɛ bio anaa wɔbɛsan ahyehyɛ. Kosi sɛ nhwehwɛmu no bɛba awiei no, yɛnka sɛ mmuae no yɛ dabi.",
  "faq.questions": "Nsɛmmisa",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Ahyɛn, mfonini, interface ne nea ɛkeka ho, sɛdeɛ sika betumi aboa. <0>Nkyerɛwee a ɛwɔ kratafa yi<\/0> kyerɛ ade biara na ɛbɛkyerɛ nsesaeɛ biara ne ne mfonini nhyehyɛfoɔ.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Wɔahyehyɛ sɛ wobetumi anya ahyɛn ne nkɔso denam agoru a woyɛ so anaa wotɔ. Sɛnea ahyɛn a wotua ka ma no bɛyɛ pɛ wɔ ɔkoɔ a nkurɔfoɔ ne nkurɔfoɔ ko mu, wɔda so rehyehyɛ no.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Ɛno ne nhyehyɛeɛ no: agoru kwa a agoru no mu sika ne ahosu nneɛma a wotumi tɔ sɛ wopɛ. Wɔnyɛɛ no ntɛm.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Wɔtwaa obi adwuma anaa?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Ɛbɛba bere bɛn, na wɔ dɛn so?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Nkyɛmu bɛn na nkurɔfoɔ bɛsesa, na mɛhu sɛn?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Adɛn nti na AI agoru bɛboa mfonini nhyehyɛfoɔ?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Ɛbɛyɛ tua na nkunim?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Ɛnni da a ɛbɛba ne boɔ bi ɛnnɛ.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude ne Claude Code yɛ Anthropic, PBC nsɛmfua nkyerɛwee. Unreal Engine ne Epic Games yɛ Epic Games, Inc. nsɛmfua nkyerɛwee. Blender yɛ Blender Foundation nsɛmfua nkyerɛwee. Quake III Arena ne Elite Dangerous yɛ wɔn dedifoɔ nsɛmfua nkyerɛwee. Din nyinaa yɛ wɔn dedifoɔ de na wɔde di dwuma de hu nneɛma a wɔreka ho asɛm nko ara. Orion-81 nni ho nkitahodie, nkamfo anaa ɛsoro bi a efi wɔn mu biara.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Anidasoɔ. Nkitahodie, abusuabɔ anaa nkamfo biara nni hɔ.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Channel reba",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Devlog wɔ YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Di Kickstarter no akyi",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Daakye nkitahodie?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Ntrasoɔ nni hɔ. Cookies nni hɔ. Nhwɛsoɔ saet. Nsɛm biara fi adwuma no archive mu; biribiara a ɛwɔ ha nyɛ ɔhyɛ anaa bɔ.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Ɛnyɛ adwuma mprempren",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Biakoyɛ baako da so ho hwehwɛ: agoru code a efi GPL nhwɛsoɔ no mu bae no <0>kwan hwehwɛ<\/0>. Automated similarity scan twaa code no ne nhwɛsoɔ no source ho ntotoɔ wɔ <1/>, na ɔbenfoɔ nhwehwɛmu a ɛfa nea ɛhyia no ho rekɔ so.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 yɛ adwuma a AI nko ara na ɛyɛeɛ.<\/0> Orion-81 ankasa code no, Claude Code na ɛyɛeɛ, ɔtedeɛ kyerɛɛ kwan; ahyɛn, maps, textures ne nne yɛ adwinnadeɛ a Claude Code twerɛeɛ no na ɛyɛeɛ. Open-source libraries a ɛde di dwuma no wɔ <1>Ɛnyɛ AI na ɛyɛeɛ<\/1> ase.",
