  "why.anthropic": "Ma Anthropic",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic": "<0>Anthropic Economic Index (<1/>)<\/0> hu sɛ adwumayɛfoɔ a wɔfi ase hu sɛ wɔn adwuma pii yɛ nea AI betumi ayɛ.",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic2": "<0>Anthropic sikasɛm mmara nhyehyɛeɛ (<1/>)<\/0> srɛ adwumakuw sɛ wɔntete nkurɔfoɔ na wɔmfa wɔn nsi baabi foforɔ sen sɛ wɔbɛtwa wɔn.",
  "why.anthropicSReview": "<0>Anthropic nhwehwɛmu a ɛfa adanseɛ a ɛfa nhwɛso ho (<1/>)<\/0> hu sɛ nhyehyɛeɛ a ɛne adwumayɛfoɔ ne adwuma bi ho hyia no yɛ papa sen biara.",
  "why.askSimpleFive": "Nea yɛrebisa no mmerɛw: Claude agyinaeɛ nnum na efi ase. Sɛ ɔtedeɛ tumi de nkurɔfoɔ a wɔwɔ nyansa ne akokoduru hyɛ mu a, yɛbɛkyerɛ sɛdeɛ wɔtumi de AI di dwuma wɔ adwene pa mu de yɛ biribi a ɛyɛ fɛ.",
  "why.context": "Mu nsɛm",
  "why.designersEngineers": "Ma mfonini nhyehyɛfoɔ ne ɛnjiniafoɔ",
  "why.everyItemBelow": "Biribiara a ɛwɔ ase no yɛ nhyehyɛeɛ anaa wɔnkyerɛ ho asɛm ntɛm. Biribiara a ɛwɔ ha, wɔnpene so, na wɔnhyɛ sika bɔ.",
  "why.founderWentFrom": "Ɔtedeɛ baako fi nhwɛsoɔ so kɔɔ 0.6.1 wɔ nna <0/> mu. Susuw nea kuw a wɔahyɛ wɔn ho nnum betumi ayɛ.",
  "why.fromAnthropic": "Fi Anthropic",
  "why.fromBackers": "Fi adwumayɛ boafoɔ",
  "why.fullyDisclosedAi": "Agoru a AI yɛeɛ a wɔakyerɛ nyinaa ne adwuma a agodifoɔ betumi ahwɛ, wɔahyehyɛ sɛ ɛbɛkɔ Unreal Engine 5 so (kwan anamɔn 3).",
  "why.fullyDocumentedExample": "Nhwɛsoɔ a wɔakyerɛw nyinaa wɔ agentic yɛ ho, fi engine kosi agoru (repository, tracker ne version biara a wɔabobɔ mu wɔakora), ne nsɔhwɛ ketewa a ɛwɔ mfaso a ɛkyerɛ kwan baako a AI mfaso betumi ayɛ sika ama nkurɔfoɔ a ɛpam wɔn.",
  "why.fundingGoalAnnounced": "Sika botaeɛ: wɔbɛka ho asɛm.",
  "why.kickstarterRoadmapPhase": "Kickstarter (kwan anamɔn 5) yɛ nkurɔfoɔ nyinaa sika boaboa a edi kan. Wɔpɛ sɛ ne sika fa developers ne mfonini nhyehyɛfoɔ a edi kan a AI ama wɔafi adwuma mu (anamɔn 6), a afei wɔsesa AI nneɛma biako biako. <0>Nea sika a edi kan no tua, adwuma biara: wɔbɛka ho asɛm.<\/0>",
  "why.linksContextOnly": "Links yɛ mu nsɛm nko ara na ɛnkyerɛ nkamfo.",
  "why.n06WhyMatters": "06 · Nea enti ɛho hia",
  "why.orion81Tests": "Orion-81 sɔ adwene no mu baako ketewa hwɛ. Ɛyɛ nhyehyɛeɛ, na wɔnfaa obi ntɛm.",
  "why.plannedPaidCredited": "Wɔahyehyɛ: adwuma a wotua ka, na wɔka din, a ɛsesa AI nneɛma biako biako, sɛdeɛ sika betumi aboa.",
  "why.publishersEngineMakers": "Ma dwumadifoɔ ne engine yɛfoɔ",
  "why.routesThatExist": "Akwan a ɛwɔ hɔ wɔ Anthropic nkurɔfoɔ nyinaa nhyehyɛeɛ mu ne Claude for Startups (credits ne Applied AI office hours) ne Claude Founder House nsɛm. Orion-81 betumi nso ayɛ baabi a nhwehwɛfoɔ a wɔresua AI-sika a wɔde san de nkurɔfoɔ ba adwuma mu bɛtumi ahwɛ. Nkɔmmɔbɔ anaa nkamfo biara nni hɔ.",
  "why.studyingAiFunded": "Woresua AI-sika a wɔde san de nkurɔfoɔ ba adwuma mu? <0>Wɔbɛka ɔkwan a wobɛfa so abɛkɔ.<\/0>",
